<BlogPost
  title="Discontinued Dairy Queen Items We Still Miss"
  description="The Dairy Queen treats you can't buy anymore: Monkey Tails, the DQ Chipper, the Breeze, Mr. Misty Kiss and more, with when each was sold and why it left."
  h1="Discontinued Dairy Queen Menu Items: What Happened to Them"
